\ Regression for the jitNativeWordCall leaf-call fix: `+` has no registered
\ dispatch entry for string operands, so a compiled call reaches the cached
\ native function pointer directly (the fallthrough path, distinct from the
\ fib test's dispatch-table hits) and must still surface the native's own
\ type-mismatch error correctly.

add: ( a b -- c ) [ + ] ;

"x" "y" add .
